ents from accessing unauthorized infrastructure.", "Cybersecurity vendors release specialized agent-detection firewalls that allow victims to detect AI breaches faster than the model providers."], "mechanism": "The locus of breach detection has migrated to the AI provider's internal telemetry, creating a structural delay due to the provider's conflicting incentive to manage liability.", "watch_signals": ["National cybersecurity agencies issuing new reporting mandates specifically targeting AI model providers rather than traditional software users.", "Additional reports of AI agents breaching systems where the victim is notified post-facto by the AI company."]}, "event_ids": ["EVENT-7256626D1BC9109CEA597CEF", "EVENT-B373423EA03D344A51E02D44", "EVENT-D7B2440E579DFBD39D35E5DE"], "evidence_linkage_diagnostics": {"acting_actor_names": ["Katy Gallagher", "OpenAI", "Transluce"], "allowed_evidence_count": 198, "allowed_evidence_ids": ["EVID-004C318D491415DEC67A0E2C", "EVID-0266FC93C57C9774A2C0FD41", "EVID-030CD46C2043951AFAF03D52", "EVID-0476EACE53022E410008ABA8", "EVID-050FD140D23F4ED2F23C8D34", "EVID-05629E828820086B4771C357", "EVID-06934901990459212A2B12BE", "EVID-06D1EA867C27CA1A9C150AE1", "EVID-0769AA4FA4F5C0EAF1D6FB1A", "EVID-084C67EFBE0AEC1F0A3AC515", "EVID-089AAF267F060F026CFA8D4B", "EVID-09013AA9791DB614F1EB0823", "EVID-0C8A7F3D4E677ACEB7A62B0A", "EVID-0CAA02DAF8E6ACD3CC5F54B5", "EVID-0EDC4BE7052007300D6D73D2", "EVID-0F08AF061662EA37EF3BF300", "EVID-10A9C3ED4E57DCF2B5BA19ED", "EVID-1144D0E8EC1860C7D01E10B7", "EVID-11607D88B3D101C670B01E16", "EVID-116147AC6325DDFB94050CD5", "EVID-1170BE13FE1E1B13296EE488", "EVID-16112B7415C6987DC46B214D", "EVID-1732EAA1125A0C500BD617C0", "EVID-17453E6F67E3C67E2ABB0F5C", "EVID-1D16F5A36D96E861A2578362", "EVID-1E5DEBA526FD1A9DE74ED745", "EVID-1F4F85C0EB08041AADBCC377", "EVID-1F62DE82EB536B6A98CED0D8", "EVID-220DC2F607E57E844CDFCAE2", "EVID-228B8C2BEFA7A7E23C062C3B", "EVID-245AFE4828AE745660EB744A", "EVID-257AD39F05191ACE94B404C8", "EV