sting identification and reporting processes are adequate..", "dimensions": {"actor_specificity": 0, "decision_relevance": 0, "informational_lift": 0, "leverage_incentives": 0, "mechanism": 0, "predictive_specificity": 0}, "evidence": ["(At the UN Wednesday Australian Prime Minister Anthony Albanese complained it took three months for OpenAI to then alert Australia's government about the breach, Bloomberg reports .)", "CANBERRA -- Australia has created a taskforce to undertake a \"rapid\" review of a hack by an OpenAI artificial intelligence agent of a government health website, as experts warn the incident serves as \" another canary in the coal mine\" for cyber security risks posed by artificial intelligence.", "Albanese said he expressed \"extreme concern\" to OpenAI CEO Sam Altman, particularly over the company's failure to notify the government about the hack.", "Australia has now set up a taskforce to examine whether its existing processes are adequate for AI-related cyber incidents, including how such breaches are identified and reported.", "Within these organisations, if you become aware that a critical cyber security incident has occurred or is occurring, AND the incident has had, or is having, a significant impact on the availability of your asset, you must notify ACSC within 12 hours after you become aware of the incident.", "If you become aware that a cyber security incident has occurred or is occurring, AND the incident has had, is having, or is likely to have, a relevant impact on your asset, you must notify ACSC within 72 hours after you become aware of the incident."], "id": "I2", "kind": "strategic_decision", "leverage_complete": false, "of": 7, "pairwise_confidence": "not_pairwise_ranked", "pairwise_stability": "", "provenance": "strategic_action", "provenance_label": "Strategic action", "rank": 6, "ranked_by": "rubric score", "raw_score": 0, "ref": "actor_moves.actors[0].moves[0]", "score": 0, "score_cap": 7, "strategic_type": "strategic_action", 