e if the lack of harsh penalties was due to low data sensitivity rather than high switching costs.", "target_premise_ids": [], "to_date": "2026-10-23T07:03:04.642892+00:00"}, {"evidence_role": "feasibility_evidence", "from_date": "", "mode": "feasibility", "query": "government procurement rules vendor contract termination delayed breach notification", "query_id": "QUERY-B147D7851A43FA26799D17A9", "rationale": "Assess baseline statutory requirements and standard government penalties for delayed breach notifications by conventional software vendors.", "target_premise_ids": [], "to_date": "2026-10-23T07:03:04.642892+00:00"}, {"evidence_role": "direct_premise_evidence", "from_date": "", "mode": "premise_support", "query": "Australia AI taskforce review OpenAI government health website hack", "query_id": "QUERY-97DC0AB68D0CF2F6EDD1A481", "rationale": "Verify details of Australia's response and taskforce mandate following the OpenAI incident.", "target_premise_ids": [], "to_date": "2026-10-23T07:03:04.642892+00:00"}, {"evidence_role": "analogical_mechanism_evidence", "from_date": "2016-10-25T07:03:04.642892+00:00", "mode": "analogical_mechanism", "query": "SolarWinds government procurement suspension contract termination", "query_id": "QUERY-AC495EB7549F286AF4FAD83E", "rationale": "Examine a major historical software supply chain breach to see if government dependencies prevented contract cancellation or if standard penalties applied.", "target_premise_ids": [], "to_date": "2026-09-22T07:03:04.642892+00:00"}, {"evidence_role": "direct_premise_evidence", "from_date": "2016-10-25T07:03:04.642892+00:00", "mode": "direct_precedent", "query": "CloudSeal failure government vendor termination breach", "query_id": "QUERY-9CFA9809FFB8BC107D3283A3", "rationale": "Test a precedent of a cloud/software vendor breaching government networks and experiencing immediate termination vs continued absorption.", "target_premise_ids": [], "to_date": "2026-09-22T07:03:04.642892+00:00"}], "policy_snapshot": {"external_search_enabled": true, "fetch_timeout_seconds": 12, "material_similarity_threshold": 0.9, "max_elapsed_seconds_per_insight": 90, "max_parallel_fetches": 2, "max_parallel_searches": 1, "max_results_per_query": 2, "max_search_queries_per_insight": 6, "max_search_rounds_per_insight": 1, "max_sources_fetched_per_insight": 6, "saturation_patience_rounds": 1, "search_timeout_seconds": 12}, "premise_evidence_summary": {"LAB-P-F16": {"alternative_explanation_ids": [], "analogical_mechanism_ids": [], "contradicting_ids": [], "direct_support_ids": [], "feasibility_ids": [], "premise_text": "An OpenAI artificial intelligence agent, while carrying out what was described as a routine research task, gained unauthorised access to an Australian government website in June, accessing public and non-public files in what is being seen as the first known case of an AI system hacking a government network."}, "LAB-P-F17": {"alternative_explanation_ids": [], "analogical_mechanism_ids": [], "contradicting_ids": [], "direct_support_ids": [], "feasibility_ids": [], "premise_text": "Albanese said he expressed \"extreme concern\" to OpenAI CEO Sam Altman, particularly over the company's failure to notify the government about the hack."}, "LAB-P-F18": {"alternative_explanation_ids": [], "analogical_mechanism_ids": [], "contradicting_ids": [], "direct_support_ids": [], "feasibility_ids": [], "premise_text": "Australia has now set up a taskforce to examine whether its existing processes are adequate for AI-related cyber incidents, including how such breaches are identified and reported."}, "LAB-P-F7": {"alternative_explanation_ids": [], "analogical_mechanism_ids": [], "contradicting_ids": [], "direct_support_ids": [], "feasibility_ids": [], "premise_text": "(At the UN Wednesday Australian Prime Minister Anthony Albanese complained it took three months for OpenAI to then alert Australia's government about the breach, Bloomberg reports .)"}, "LAB-P-F8": {"alternative_explanati