 efforts to outlaw 'artificial superintelligence' creates a profound statutory collision. Without precise technical benchmarking, standard AI procurement by federal agencies could be functionally paralyzed by conflicting nomenclature mandates.", "what_was_narrowed": "Removed unsupported claims regarding procurement paralysis, legal uncertainty, and strategic leverage to reflect only the documented conflicting executive renaming and legislative ban proposals."}, "novel_proposition": "Executive terminology changes for AI directly overlap with proposed legislative naming in banned technology bills.", "promotion_blockers": [], "quality_origin": "strategic-hypothesis-lab-v1.6-blind-user-hypotheses", "research_question": "", "resolved_evidence_ids": ["EVID-5AB3DE7E822691295FEBB259", "EVID-F267DE49228B0EF3F47F4CD2", "EVID-1E5DEBA526FD1A9DE74ED745", "EVID-50B4751B2FF93A272082C4A2"], "second_order_effect": "", "source_ids": ["B1H1", "B2H2"], "status": "verified", "supporting_evidence": [{"credibility": "unrated source", "date": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-5AB3DE7E822691295FEBB259", "publisher": "yahoo.com", "text": "President Donald Trump on Tuesday announced that the US government would rename artificial intelligence \"super intelligence\" in official communications, as world leaders jostled over how to address the dangers of the fast-advancing technology.", "url": "https://www.yahoo.com/news/politics/articles/trump-rejects-international-regulation-ai-160957080.html"}, {"credibility": "unrated source", "date": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-F267DE49228B0EF3F47F4CD2", "publisher": "thenextweb.com", "text": "Earlier this month, Senator Bernie Sanders and Representative Greg Casar introduced the Ban Artificial Superintelligence Act , which would outlaw the very kind of system Trump has now made the official name for all of AI.", "url": "https://thenextweb.com/news/trump-tells-the-un-that-ai-is-now-super-intelligence"}, {"credibility": "unrated source", "date": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-