t", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_resolved", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "VN. ai , a tech startup that stress tests generative artificial intelligence tools for copyright infringement, has produced its first quarterly report examining how 15 popular AI models performed when it comes to flouting studio IP. The research conducted last month found that Midjourney v8.1 was the worst offender when it came to reproducing images of copyrighted characters. According to VN.ai's report, which was shared with Deadline, Midjourney reproduced images of characters that violated brand safety measures once in every three text prompts, or 37% of the time."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-6E3D84C20446BDAF8BAC5FDE", "source_id": "SOURCE-8D1384B974E687FC85F2771E", "admission_status": "excluded", "admission_reasons": ["topic_relevance_below_threshold", "ai_link_not_verified", "topic_linkage_not_strategic:none"], "resolved_primary_actor": "Google Cloud", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "Google Cloud", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_date_precision", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_resolved", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "During a significant Google Cloud outage in June 2025, a new feature was activated globally rather than through a gradual rollout, according to Google's subsequent incident report . When the change triggered failures, the broad deployment meant the impact was immediate across multiple regions and services, including third-party platforms dependent on Google Cloud infrastructure."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-E4884053848DDC40ED37A7B2", "source_id": "SOURCE-8D1384B974E687FC85F2771E", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "Google", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "Google", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}, {"mention": "new code", "entity_type": "unknown", "role": "object", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_date_precision", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_resolved", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "Google CEO Sundar Pichai recently stated in Alphabet's annual report , \"Today, nearly 75% of all new code at