ing - SiliconANGLE AI infrastructure management software startup ASI hits $3B valuation after raising $325M in funding by Mike Wheatley An artificial intelligence startup called ASI Inc. , which builds complex models of air traffic and energy grids, said today it has scored $325 million in a Series C funding, bringing its valuation to a cool $3 billion. The round was led by Spark Capital and joined by participants including Citadel Securities, Craft Ventures, Meritech Capital, Energy Impact Partners and Andreessen Horowitz. Today we announced our $325M Series C to scale America's... pic.twitter.com/l133h8H92E"}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-0B0047B2B2587CE1EC6813EE", "source_id": "SOURCE-101FE3CF30E589C71CD6D351", "admission_status": "excluded", "admission_reasons": ["topic_relevance_below_threshold", "ai_link_not_verified", "topic_linkage_not_strategic:none"], "resolved_primary_actor": "ASI", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "ASI", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_date_precision", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_resolved", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "Going forward, ASI said the money from today's round will help it expand further into the aviation, defense and energy sectors and also target n