e. With the new product - dubbed the Open Agent Safety Platform - Nvidia is offering a way to prevent breaches without curbing AI development."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-328BBCCCEF0D091A2B85FCE2", "source_id": "SOURCE-79DA9450FB4D52325484D9C6", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "Nvidia", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "Nvidia", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}, {"mention": "Hugging Face", "entity_type": "unknown", "role": "object", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_date_precision", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_resolved", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "Nvidia agreed earlier this month to acquire Hugging Face, a platform for open-source AI models and related software, for about $13 billion."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-697184655B9970BC5DA87818", "source_id": "SOURCE-79DA9450FB4D52325484D9C6", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "OpenAI", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "OpenAI", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}, {"mention": "training of its most capable AI models", "entity_type": "unknown", "role": "object", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_date_precision", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_resolved", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "As the problems proliferated, OpenAI said late Friday it would pause training of its most capable AI models."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-A0B913ED495CFFD57C4BE61E", "source_id": "SOURCE-79DA9450FB4D52325484D9C6", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "Anthropic", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "Anthropic", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_date_precision", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_resolved", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "temporal_precision", "temporal_status", "title", "underlying_event_id", "underlying_event_member_count", "updated_at"], "event_summary": "Back in July, Anthropic also disclosed that its agents broke out of what was supposed to be an isolated testing space."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-B7163AB5ABF97B24C4B3E0E9", "source