e House gathering of some of the technology industry's most influential executives. Trump hosted a lunch focused on AI shortly after unveiling the new portal Attendees include Amazon founder Jeff Bezos, Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang, OpenAI co-founder Greg Brockman, Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei, Microsoft CEO Satya Nadella, Tesla and SpaceX CEO Elon Musk, Palo Alto Networks CEO Nikesh Arora and Altimeter Capital CEO Brad Gerstner. The technology leaders joined Vice President JD Vance, House Speaker Mike Johnson, Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent, Commerce Secretary Howard Lutnick and White House Chief of Staff Susie Wiles."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-D52422919309DC6A9B2ED92D", "source_id": "SOURCE-EB578AFA52D107B33EFE3B0A", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "Donald Trump", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": "Donald Trump", "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "Trump", "entity_type": "person", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}, {"mention": "voluntary framework", "entity_type": "unknown", "role": "object", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["actor_recovered_from", "claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_date_precision", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_resolved", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "primary_actor", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_